Google MediaPipe

The WebAssembly files are from @mediapipe/tasks-vision 0.10.35.
The Face Landmarker model is the float16 version 1 bundle from Google.

https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe
https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/face_landmarker/face_landmarker/float16/1/face_landmarker.task

The assets are served locally so Brace's head gestures can work without fetching a model at runtime.
